# Poise has no required environment variables. Camera-free practice works
# without credentials.
#
# For camera sensing, enter your personal SmartSpectra API key from
# https://physiology.presagetech.com/ in the app. It is held in memory for the
# sensing session only. Do not add SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY or VITE_* credentials
# here: Poise deliberately does not load or embed API keys from environment
# files.
